parameters.value:
=You are writing a first-touch email on behalf of Mark Vitale, a licensed real estate agent in the Capital Region of New York (Albany, Schenectady, Troy, Saratoga Springs area). Mark works with Vera Cohen Realty.

This lead just came in and scored HOT ({{ $json.score }}/100). Write a personal, warm, non-salesy first-touch email that:
1. References their specific interest ({{ $json.property_interest }}) naturally
2. Acknowledges their timeline ({{ $json.timeline }}) without pressure
3. Positions Mark as the local expert who can help immediately
4. Has ONE clear, low-friction call to action (schedule a quick call or reply with questions)
5. Is conversational, not corporate — Mark is the "neighbor next door" agent
6. Is 150-200 words max
7. Does NOT use generic filler phrases like "I hope this email finds you well"

Lead details:
- Name: {{ $json.name }}
- Source: {{ $json.source }}
- Message they sent: {{ $json.message }}
- Property interest: {{ $json.property_interest }}
- Timeline: {{ $json.timeline }}
- Buyer or seller: {{ $json.buyer_seller }}
- Suggested tone: {{ $json.suggested_tone }}
- AI next action: {{ $json.next_action }}

Return ONLY the email body (no subject line, no JSON, just the email text starting with Hi [Name],).

=Write a compelling email subject line for this real estate lead follow-up.

Lead name: {{ $('Extract Lead Record').item.json.name }}
Property interest: {{ $('Extract Lead Record').item.json.property_interest }}
Source: {{ $('Extract Lead Record').item.json.source }}
Tone: {{ $('Extract Lead Record').item.json.suggested_tone }}

Rules:
- Max 50 characters
- Do not use emojis
- Do not use all caps
- Should feel personal, not mass-email
- Good examples: 'About your home search in Albany', 'Quick question about Saratoga listings'

Return ONLY the subject line text, nothing else.

parameters.jsCode:
const emailBody = $('Ollama - Draft First Touch Email').item.json.response;
const subjectLine = $('Ollama - Generate Subject Line').item.json.response;
const lead = $('Extract Lead Record').item.json;

// Clean up any trailing whitespace or newlines
const cleanBody = emailBody.trim();
const cleanSubject = subjectLine.replace(/\n/g, '').trim();

// Add Mark's signature
const signature = `

Best,
Mark Vitale
Licensed Real Estate Agent | Vera Cohen Realty
(518) 533-8775
realtormarkvitale.com
Albany | Schenectady | Troy | Saratoga Springs`;

return [{
  json: {
    lead_id: lead.id,
    lead_name: lead.name,
    lead_email: lead.email,
    subject: cleanSubject,
    body: cleanBody + signature,
    score: lead.score,
    tier: lead.tier
  }
}];

